{"id":881210,"imdb":"tt0075143","en":"The Message","orig":"Al-risâlah","ar":"الرسالة","tag":null,"ov":"في القرن السادس الميلادي في مكة، يُبعث محمد (ص) رسولًا وبعد ثلاث سنوات من البعثة، يتلو ما يوحى إليه. يقرر أبو سفيان وزوجته هند الوقوف ضد سيدنا مُحمد لكن الرسول لا يكف عن دعوته، يتم تعذيب المسلمين مثل سيدنا بلال وعمار ابن ياسر، كما يقف سيدنا حمزة بن عبدالمطلب إلى جوار عمه ويُعلن إسلامه.","rd":"1976-07-30","rt":206,"g":[36,18,12],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Filmco International Productions","logo":null,"c":"LY"}],"countries":["DZ","KW","LY","MA","SA"],"langs":["Arabic","English","French"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"GB","d":"1976-07-30"},{"c":"TR","d":"1977-01-31"},{"c":"PT","d":"1977-09-09"},{"c":"FR","d":"2011-11-09"},{"c":"AE","d":"2018-06-14"},{"c":"BH","d":"2018-06-14"},{"c":"OM","d":"2018-06-14"},{"c":"QA","d":"2018-06-14"},{"c":"SA","d":"2018-06-14"}],"dir":["Moustapha Akkad"],"prod":["Moustapha Akkad"],"wri":["Mohamed Ali Maher","Abdel Hamid Gouda El Sahhar","Ahmed Shalaby","Abderrahman Charkawi","Tawfiq Al-Hakim"],"mus":["Maurice Jarre"],"dop":["Jack Hildyard"],"cast":[{"n":"Abdallah Ghaith","ch":"Hamza ibn al-Muttalib","p":"/7dVgNjKzIHWW80eMKRu7ko3Ywnz.jpg"},{"n":"Ali Ahmed Salem","ch":"Bilal ibn Rabah","p":"/3NJLBNWdwYBJvp9TU3Bzi1xWRax.jpg"},{"n":"Muhammad al-Arabi","ch":"Ammar ibn Yasir","p":"/A6KBVVhN2BOnvJY703esQPCxh0E.jpg"},{"n":"Mounir Moasery","ch":"Djafar ibn Abi Talib","p":"/qQV2MushtNSclinrb4vo9DZd0wA.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Marei","ch":"Zayd ibn Harithah","p":"/fiOzIc6igNlFmsgqvk3n2G8Nyln.jpg"},{"n":"Habib Ageli","ch":"Houdhayfa ibn Utba","p":"/vgPwSl4WrxfGnsbUwO8WkqeqCYu.jpg"},{"n":"Hamdy Ghaith","ch":"Abou Sufyan ibn Harb","p":"/2ncZ7niUc54L0DWKqdb0EZkLpGh.jpg"},{"n":"Mona Wasef","ch":"Hind bint Utba","p":"/lx2GQ3a7KHpITya81AwaGciTlHN.jpg"},{"n":"Hassan al-Jundi","ch":"Abou al-Hakam","p":"/zsbK50dUtFZzY8aA6r38DieN13K.jpg"},{"n":"Abd al-Badi Arabi","ch":"Utba","p":"/2PGg0MNh71dRdhmSL2XEIvgc4Ro.jpg"},{"n":"Tayeb Saddiki","ch":"Al-